==Strategy==
Like the previous stages, this one is absurdly easy, even in {{3c}}, since the Zombie enemies only reach up to 60% strength. All you need to do is spam attackers like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall]] will work just fine for meatshields.

